{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/store_capsule_main_english.png?t=1747219653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you play as the protagonist and make your way through the story in visual novel format. Sit back, relax, and enjoy the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/story_eng.png?t=1747219653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's polished, caring, kind, and gets good grades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're just enjoying your life with her when one day, you get into an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you wake up in the hospital, you've forgotten all about your family, friends\u2026 and her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You try to restore your memories, but other women approach you, taking advantage of your amnesia with half-truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you get your memories back and return to those blissful days with your girlfriend?<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/kaede2.gif?t=1747219653\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/characters_eng.png?t=1747219653\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/Iori_Kurose_eng.png?t=1747219653\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/Nagisa_Kitatani_eng.png?t=1747219653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/Akari_Hoshino_eng.png?t=1747219653\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/features_eng.png?t=1747219653\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Honey Trap Amnesia uses live2D to show moving images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even though you have a girlfriend, you give into temptation and cheat on her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your amnesia to your advantage and find yourself a new girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision you make counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/kaede-nagisa1.gif?t=1747219653\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3315800?t=1747219653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747219653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/ae90a6e21910fceec2d430b0e4be85987d4155ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747219653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/ae90a6e21910fceec2d430b0e4be85987d4155ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747219653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features three heroines who try to seduce the main character. There are some sexual innuendos and slightly revealing outfits. Please do not play this game if you are uncomfortable with this content."},"demos":[{"appid":3496420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/store_capsule_main_english.png?t=1747219653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you play as the protagonist and make your way through the story in visual novel format. Sit back, re